      "message": "feat(packaging): the logotype in the exe, installer, .icns and Linux icons\n\nPackaging scripts read assets/logo/icons (cargo xtask logo) instead of\ncube.png; the installer sets SetupIconFile; crates/ui/build.rs embeds the\n.ico in the Windows exe through winresource (new build dependency).\n\nFixes #1461\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
